MethbokeAddon.FDSN.transportModeTerm_zero_output : ∀ (c : SingularClosure.FourierCoeff) (p : SingularClosure.Frequency)
  (i : Fin 3), Eq.{1} (MethbokeAddon.FDSN.transportModeTerm c 0 p i) 0
TYPE_END:MethbokeAddon.FDSN.transportModeTerm_zero_output
AXIOMS_BEGIN:MethbokeAddon.FDSN.transportModeTerm_zero_output
